											Prof. Deepak Bansal is a Doctorate in Finance from Uttarakhand Technical University, Dehradun. He is the Master of Business Administration with specialization in Finance & Marketing from UPTU, Lucknow. He is the Master of Philosophy from Madurai Kamraj University, Madurai and the Master of Commerce from CCS University, Meerut. He is a bachelor in Education and Commerce. He has worked in various management institutes of repute in NCR Region. Presently he is associated with GNIOT Institute of Management Studies, Greater Noida. His area of interest includes Venture Capital Financing, Financial Management, Accounting for Management, Income Tax, Security Analysis and Portfolio Management, Financial Derivatives, Mergers, Acquisitions & Corporate Restructuring, and Financial Markets & Institutions. He has more than 18 years of academic, industry & research experience. He is in editorial board of repute journals. He has presented several research papers in National/International Journals and Conferences. He has organized and attended several workshops, conferences, seminars, FDPs and summits of national and international repute.
